In Email preferences, you can choose which Centrapay emails you receive. These include:

- **Daily Settlement** - sent daily, with the settlement breakdown for each merchant site.
- **Billing Invoice** - sent monthly, covering the business's Centrapay fees for the month.

![Examples of the Daily Settlement and Billing Invoice emails](/email-preferences/email-preferences-overview.png)

## Turn a Subscription On or Off

1. If you're not already in the Business Portal, [log in](https://app.centrapay.com/business).

2. Select **Settings** in the left-hand navigation.

3. Open **Email preferences**.

   ![Email preferences card in the Settings menu](/email-preferences/email-preferences-settings.png)

4. Switch a subscription on to subscribe, or off to unsubscribe.

   ![Toggling Daily Settlement and Billing Invoice subscriptions on or off](/email-preferences/email-preferences-toggle.png)
